Package: fosos-theme
Version: 0.6.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, dmz-cursor-theme, plymouth, lxpolkit
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS desktop branding and defaults
 Wallpaper, Dawn Aperture logo, boot splash, session defaults, and
 touchpad tap-to-click via libinput. The FosOS LightDM greeter and desktop
 GTK/icon themes ship in fosos-desktop (Adwaita icons as fallback).
 lxpolkit provides password prompts. Greybird and elementary-xfce are no
 longer pulled into the image.
